        "source": {
          "datasheet": {
            "doc": "Nichicon UVR",
            "at": "Tangent of loss angle (tan δ) max 0.20 at 120 Hz, 20 °C, for a rated voltage of 16 V. The series resistance is tan δ / (2 π f C) at the capacitance set, 2.65 ohm at 100 µF.",
